# T-402: scripts and text fixtures are always LF, even where text=auto's detection or a local
# core.autocrlf would otherwise check them out with CRLF (a shebang line ending in \r, or a golden
# event script / fixture byte-compared on Linux, fails). Never add binary formats here.
